|ğ¸#|"+2|ğ¸!||ğ¸#|cosÎ¦=PSF(ğ‘¥*,ğ‘¦*)âˆ’ğµ and |ğ¸!|"â‰…ğµ. 
Then the signal minus the background of the image followed by 
