particles from the same product number (900172, Sigma-Aldrich). This figure is presented in the same manner as 
Figure S8. The SHIP images, one by experiment (top) and one by simulation (bottom) with the best parameter 
values : the fit results (ni, zp) = (1.521, 0.012 Î¼m) for (a), (ni, zp) = (1.518, 0.022 Î¼m) for (b), and (ni, zp) = (1.516, 
0.045 Î¼m) for (c) with design parameters (ns, np, ni*, ng*, ti*, tg*) = (1.33, 2.4, 1.52, 1.52, 100 Î¼m, 170 Î¼m), exhibit 
clear similarity, indicating the reliability of the parameters obtained here. It is also notable that the size of fND is 
highly heterogeneous. 
 
  

